# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in. `pnpm tauri:dev` sources it.
#
# Optional. Set TINFOIL_API_KEY to skip the macOS keychain while developing:
# every `tauri dev` rebuild gets a new ad-hoc code signature, so the keychain
# treats it as a different app and re-prompts for your device password no
# matter how often you click "Always Allow". With this set, debug builds keep
# secrets in memory for the session instead (`mod dev` in secrets.rs).
#
# Left empty or unset, the app uses the OS keychain, exactly like release.
# Not read by the frontend: Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed vars.
TINFOIL_API_KEY=
